01:01:40.260 --> 01:01:44.560
finally has someone who has to go through the tough parts of being a boss with him.
终于有了个能和他一起经历当老板艰难时刻的人。

1407
01:01:44.840 --> 01:01:50.220
And Jen said that she just loved that they could hide in the boss's office together at
詹说她特别喜欢他们俩能在剧集结尾时一起

1408
01:01:50.220 --> 01:01:51.120
the end of the episode.
躲在老板的办公室里。

1409
01:01:51.120 --> 01:01:53.760
Yeah, I liked that moment, too.
对，我也很喜欢那个时刻。

1410
01:01:53.960 --> 01:01:54.620
I did, too.
我也是。

1411
01:01:55.400 --> 01:01:58.380
Well, now we're going to have this final tag at the end.
好了，现在我们来看看结尾的这个彩蛋片段。

1412
01:01:59.360 --> 01:02:04.560
Ryan's going to come into the break room where Pam is dipping her pretzels in something.
瑞安走进休息室，看到帕姆正把蝴蝶饼蘸着什么东西吃。

1413
01:02:04.800 --> 01:02:05.980
What am I dipping them in?
我到底蘸的是什么？

1414
01:02:06.260 --> 01:02:07.180
I don't remember.
我不记得了。

1415
01:02:07.460 --> 01:02:08.960
I don't know why I made this choice.
我不知道自己当时为什么要这么选。

1416
01:02:09.240 --> 01:02:11.680
Do you think it was some actory method choice?
你觉得这是某种演员的体验派选择吗？

1417
01:02:11.680 --> 01:02:12.700
Like, oh, I'm pregnant.
就像，哦，我怀孕了。

1418
01:02:12.700 --> 01:02:14.840
I'm probably having odd cravings.
我可能嘴会比较馋。

1419
01:02:14.960 --> 01:02:17.200
I'll take pretzels and dip it in something weird.
我要拿蝴蝶饼蘸点奇怪的东西。

1420
01:02:17.480 --> 01:02:18.760
Yes, I think you're right.
是的，我觉得你说得对。

1421
01:02:18.760 --> 01:02:19.880
That sounds like me.
这很符合我的风格。

1422
01:02:21.120 --> 01:02:23.820
Because in real life, I don't dip my pretzels in anything.
因为在现实生活中，我吃蝴蝶饼什么都不蘸。

1423
01:02:23.820 --> 01:02:25.640
So I don't know what this was.
所以我不知道这到底是什么。

1424
01:02:26.260 --> 01:02:31.180
I cannot believe that Pam falls for this Ryan crapola.
我真不敢相信帕姆居然会吃瑞安这一套鬼话。

1425
01:02:31.560 --> 01:02:33.180
I cannot believe she falls for it.
我真不敢相信她会上当。

1426
01:02:33.380 --> 01:02:39.880
He's like, would you rather have $100 today or $5,000 a year from now?
他说，你是愿意今天拿100美元，还是五年后拿5000美元？

1427
01:02:40.440 --> 01:02:42.700
Well, at first she says $100 today.
好吧，一开始她说今天拿100美元。

1428
01:02:42.700 --> 01:02:43.560
No, I know.
不，我懂。

1429
01:02:43.560 --> 01:02:45.760
I know her first instincts are so right.
我知道她的第一直觉其实很准。

1430
01:02:45.960 --> 01:02:48.660
But Ryan is such a con man and he wears her down.
但瑞安是个不折不扣的骗子，他把她说动了。

1431
01:02:49.100 --> 01:02:54.420
Well, listen, he has a guy that has an algorithm that can determine the winner of any given college
好吧，听着，他认识一个人，那人有个算法能算出任何一场大学

1432
01:02:54.420 --> 01:02:55.460
basketball game.
篮球比赛的赢家。

1433
01:02:56.080 --> 01:02:59.140
Why is Ryan still working as a temp then?
那为什么瑞安还在当临时工？

1434
01:03:00.400 --> 01:03:01.900
So I did the math.
所以我算了一下。

1435
01:03:02.240 --> 01:03:04.380
Pam writes Ryan a check for $50.
帕姆给瑞安开了一张50美元的支票。

1436
01:03:05.420 --> 01:03:07.600
Kevin gave her $40 earlier.
凯文之前给了她40美元。

1437
01:03:08.040 --> 01:03:10.420
She has lost $10 today.
她今天已经亏了10美元。

1438
01:03:11.500 --> 01:03:11.720
Yep.
没错。

1439
01:03:12.300 --> 01:03:13.440
It's not going great.
情况不太妙啊。

1440
01:03:13.740 --> 01:03:16.960
Why can't Crate and Barrel just make a toaster full of cash?
为什么Crate and Barrel不能直接出一款塞满现金的烤面包机呢？

1441
01:03:17.340 --> 01:03:18.240
I don't know.
我也不知道。

1442
01:03:18.420 --> 01:03:19.860
We'd all register for that.
我们肯定都会去登记索取那个的。

1443
01:03:20.080 --> 01:03:20.860
We sure would.
那是肯定的。

1444
01:03:22.300 --> 01:03:23.100
All right.
好了。

1445
01:03:23.300 --> 01:03:24.920
That is the promotion.
这就是促销活动。

1446
01:03:25.240 --> 01:03:31.440
We hope you go out today and have a fantastic day full of love's eternal glory.
我们希望你们今天出门，度过充满真爱永恒光辉的美好一天。

1447
01:03:32.240 --> 01:03:33.720
We're sending you big hugs.
我们给你们一个大大的拥抱。

1448
01:03:34.100 --> 01:03:34.580
Yeah.
好。

1449
01:03:34.760 --> 01:03:35.900
Maybe get yourself a plant.
也许给自己买株植物吧。

1450
01:03:36.120 --> 01:03:37.100
I recommend it.
我推荐买一盆。

1451
01:03:37.720 --> 01:03:40.080
Maybe you need to go watch a battle cry speech.
也许你需要去看一段战前鼓舞士气的演讲。

1452
01:03:40.400 --> 01:03:41.820
Get you going for the whole week.
能让你一整个星期都动力满满。

1453
01:03:43.220 --> 01:03:46.220
Make a pros cons list and see how you feel in three days.
列一张利弊清单，看看三天后你有什么感觉。

1454
01:03:46.440 --> 01:03:47.140
Then decide.
然后再做决定。

1455
01:03:48.100 --> 01:03:49.740
Have a great week, you guys.
祝大家有个美好的一周。

1456
01:03:49.960 --> 01:03:50.420
Bye.
再见。

1457
01:03:50.420 --> 01:03:50.580
Bye.
再见。

